  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 14th level, synergized allies are always treated as if they knew a single major motivation from each other for determining their abilities (including synergy benefits). Additionally, whenever the advisor uses coordinate synergy, they can choose two synergy benefits instead of one to grant to the synergized allies. This only applies to the first instance of synergy between two specific allies, and not subsequent ones the same allies may share.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/advisor#toc36\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
